# A New Dawn (jeuno 62): Sturm's death reads the status. A BST 75 with A New Dawn accepted and the var 4 (GM) at the
# first Sarcophagus: the three NMs popped; the quest set completed (GM); Sturm killed: the var stays 4 (its script
# despawns Taifun and Trombe).
char zone=TheEldiemeNecropolis pos=-410.4,6.5,503.0 job=BST lvl=75
quest Jeuno.ANewDawn accepted
charvar ANewDawn_Event 4
login
trigger Sarcophagus                     # accepted, the first, the var 4: Sturm, Taifun, Trombe popped; no event
quest Jeuno.ANewDawn completed
kill STURM                              # completed, the var 4: nothing (the var stays 4); Taifun and Trombe despawned
